{"id":"965756ac48f54b4e","group":"58","path":"58/batch04/58-df-saturation.md","title":"Saturation","display":"df-saturation — Saturation","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Set Theory","book_abbrev":"58","label":"58-df-saturation","aliases":["58-df-saturation"],"display":"df-saturation — Saturation","depends_on":["[[../batch10/58-df-type.md]]","[[../batch11/58-df-cardinal.md]]","[[../batch18/58-df-satisfaction.md]]","[[../batch18/58-df-structure.md]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Set Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"58"},{"key":"label","html":"58-df-saturation"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>58-df-saturation</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-saturation — Saturation"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"c8dfa3853919882a\" href=\"?note=c8dfa3853919882a\" title=\"../batch10/58-df-type.md\">../batch10/58-df-type.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"5fb1c2241d1943d1\" href=\"?note=5fb1c2241d1943d1\" title=\"../batch11/58-df-cardinal.md\">../batch11/58-df-cardinal.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"8b6a90316aad78a4\" href=\"?note=8b6a90316aad78a4\" title=\"../batch18/58-df-satisfaction.md\">../batch18/58-df-satisfaction.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"d9b8711cda3f31ca\" href=\"?note=d9b8711cda3f31ca\" title=\"../batch18/58-df-structure.md\">../batch18/58-df-structure.md</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal M,\\mathcal L,\\kappa,A,p,a\\in V\">\\(\\mathcal M,\\mathcal L,\\kappa,A,p,a\\in V\\)</span></li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Struct}_S,\\mathrm{Univ},\\mathrm{Cardinal}_S,\\mathrm{CompleteType}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{Struct}_S,\\mathrm{Univ},\\mathrm{Cardinal}_S,\\mathrm{CompleteType}_S\\)</span>, and <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{RealizesType}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{RealizesType}_S\\)</span> (notions from dependencies)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Sat}_S\\subseteq V^3\">\\(\\mathrm{Sat}_S\\subseteq V^3\\)</span> (saturation predicate defined here)</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{df\\text{-}saturation}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{Sat}_S(\\mathcal M,\\mathcal L,\\kappa)\n\\leftrightarrow{}&amp;\n\\mathrm{Struct}_S(\\mathcal M,\\mathcal L)\n\\land\\mathrm{Cardinal}_S(\\kappa)\n\\land\\omega\\subseteq\\kappa\\\\\n&amp;{}\\land\n\\forall A\\subseteq\\mathrm{Univ}(\\mathcal M)\\;\n\\Bigl(\n|A|&lt;\\kappa\n\\to\n\\forall p\\;\n\\bigl(\n\\mathrm{CompleteType}_S(p,A,\\operatorname{Th}(\\mathcal M),\\mathcal L,1)\\\\\n&amp;\\hspace{37mm}\\to\n\\exists a\\in\\mathrm{Univ}(\\mathcal M)\\;\\mathrm{RealizesType}_S(\\mathcal M,\\langle a\\rangle,p)\n\\bigr)\n\\Bigr).\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{df\\text{-}saturation}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{Sat}_S(\\mathcal M,\\mathcal L,\\kappa)\n\\leftrightarrow{}&amp;\n\\mathrm{Struct}_S(\\mathcal M,\\mathcal L)\n\\land\\mathrm{Cardinal}_S(\\kappa)\n\\land\\omega\\subseteq\\kappa\\\\\n&amp;{}\\land\n\\forall A\\subseteq\\mathrm{Univ}(\\mathcal M)\\;\n\\Bigl(\n|A|&lt;\\kappa\n\\to\n\\forall p\\;\n\\bigl(\n\\mathrm{CompleteType}_S(p,A,\\operatorname{Th}(\\mathcal M),\\mathcal L,1)\\\\\n&amp;\\hspace{37mm}\\to\n\\exists a\\in\\mathrm{Univ}(\\mathcal M)\\;\\mathrm{RealizesType}_S(\\mathcal M,\\langle a\\rangle,p)\n\\bigr)\n\\Bigr).\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>Saturation means realizing all small complete one-types; both completeness and realization now reuse the exact predicates supplied by the type atom.</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"../batch10/58-df-type.md","status":"resolved","id":"c8dfa3853919882a","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch10/58-df-type.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch11/58-df-cardinal.md","status":"resolved","id":"5fb1c2241d1943d1","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch11/58-df-cardinal.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch18/58-df-satisfaction.md","status":"resolved","id":"8b6a90316aad78a4","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch18/58-df-satisfaction.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch18/58-df-structure.md","status":"resolved","id":"d9b8711cda3f31ca","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch18/58-df-structure.md]]","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"\\mathcal M,\\mathcal L,\\kappa,A,p,a\\in V","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Struct}_S,\\mathrm{Univ},\\mathrm{Cardinal}_S,\\mathrm{CompleteType}_S","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{RealizesType}_S","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Sat}_S\\subseteq V^3","display":false},{"tex":"\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{df\\text{-}saturation}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{Sat}_S(\\mathcal M,\\mathcal L,\\kappa)\n\\leftrightarrow{}&\n\\mathrm{Struct}_S(\\mathcal M,\\mathcal L)\n\\land\\mathrm{Cardinal}_S(\\kappa)\n\\land\\omega\\subseteq\\kappa\\\\\n&{}\\land\n\\forall A\\subseteq\\mathrm{Univ}(\\mathcal M)\\;\n\\Bigl(\n|A|<\\kappa\n\\to\n\\forall p\\;\n\\bigl(\n\\mathrm{CompleteType}_S(p,A,\\operatorname{Th}(\\mathcal M),\\mathcal L,1)\\\\\n&\\hspace{37mm}\\to\n\\exists a\\in\\mathrm{Univ}(\\mathcal M)\\;\\mathrm{RealizesType}_S(\\mathcal M,\\langle a\\rangle,p)\n\\bigr)\n\\Bigr).\n\\end{aligned}","display":true}],"bytes":1340,"backlinks":[{"id":"84daad544872cc71","anchor":"ref-1115","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[../batch04/58-df-saturation.md|58-df-saturation]]（batch04）"}],"outgoing":["c8dfa3853919882a","5fb1c2241d1943d1","8b6a90316aad78a4","d9b8711cda3f31ca"]}